</main>

<section class="sandbox" aria-label="Model sandbox">
  <h2>Try the model yourself</h2>
  <p>Move a slider and the board re-ranks live from the same snapshot figures. The sandbox never changes board.json — the submitted board is the entry.</p>
  <label>Growth weight <input type="range" id="growthWeight" min="0" max="1" step="0.05" value="0.5"> <output id="growthWeightOut">0.50</output></label>
  <label>Maturity floor <input type="range" id="maturityFloor" min="0.5" max="0.8" step="0.05" value="0.6"> <output id="maturityFloorOut">0.60</output></label>
  <button type="button" id="resetModel">Reset to the submitted model</button>
  <p class="note" id="sandboxNote" hidden>The board below is re-ranked with your settings. Reset to see the submitted board.</p>
